# A change followed by its exact revert.
=== initial
@expect-output A
--- Main.hx
class Main {
	static function main() {
		trace(Dep.name());
	}
}
--- Dep.hx
class Dep {
	public static function name() return "A";
}

=== change
@expect-output B
--- Dep.hx
class Dep {
	public static function name() return "B";
}

=== revert
